                                        "entry_id": "231f3e83-c716-305b-aa44-5ca2587a32fd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A currency issued in 1923 in Weimar Germany to counter hyperinflation. It was subdivided into 100 Rentenpfennig and was replaced in 1924 by the Reichsmark."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
